SUMMARY:Imagine a Canada: Art and Essay Stream 2027
LOCATION:Canada-wide student program
DESCRIPTION:The National Centre for Truth and Reconciliation runs Imagine
  a Canada as a recurring program for Kindergarten through Grade 12 and C
 EGEP students. Grade 4 students may submit an essay or another creative 
 representation of a reconciled Canada. The organizer has not announced a
  2027 edition\, deadline\, fee\, or word limit. January 1 serves as a ca
 lendar watch marker for the next cycle.
